WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.999 line:0
Two players, ten marbles each, all positions public.
Fill the opposite corner first to win.

00:00:07.999 --> 00:00:12.499 line:0
Select a marble, then its destination: a step into
an empty hole, or a jump over one marble.

00:00:12.499 --> 00:00:18.999 line:0
Jumped marbles are not captured;
any colour can be a stepping stone.

00:00:18.999 --> 00:00:29.999 line:0
Jumps can chain and turn: select the start and
the final hole, and the route is found for you.

00:00:29.999 --> 00:00:44.999 line:0
Fast-forward: the marbles meet in the middle and
use each other as stepping stones.

00:00:44.999 --> 00:00:51.749 line:0
East’s target corner needs one more marble;
some of North’s marbles have not arrived.

00:00:51.749 --> 00:00:55.999 line:0
East fills the last hole: ten of ten arrived,
and the game ends at once.

00:00:55.999 --> 00:01:06.000 line:0
East has 10/10 arrived and North 7/10;
East fills the target corner first and wins.
